<title>USA: Raymond James wins Orange Cty, Fla., $25 mln TANs.</title>
<headline>Raymond James wins Orange Cty, Fla., $25 mln TANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James &amp; Associates said the firm won $25 million of Orange County, Fla., school district tax anticipation notes (TANs).</p>
<p>The true interest cost was 3.4569 percent and the coupon was 4.00 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
